00:17:31.277 --> 00:17:32.562
Come on.

00:17:32.562 --> 00:17:33.395
- Oh gosh.

00:17:33.395 --> 00:17:34.228
- Come on.

00:17:34.228 --> 00:17:35.061
- Oh, it got away from me, didn't it?

00:17:35.061 --> 00:17:36.053
- It did a little.

00:17:36.053 --> 00:17:36.900
